 and running.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"922\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1.webp\" alt=\"how to use chatgpt\" class=\"wp-image-14312\" style=\"width:916px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1.webp 1920w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1-300x144.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1-1024x492.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1-768x369.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/how-to-use-chatgpt-1-1536x738.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sign Up or Log In<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"922\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in.webp\" alt=\"chatgpt signup\" class=\"wp-image-14316\" style=\"width:906px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in.webp 1920w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in-300x144.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in-1024x492.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in-768x369.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-log-in-1536x738.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Head over to <a href=\"https:\/\/chatgpt.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">chatgpt.com<\/a> You\u2019ll need to sign up using your email address, Google, Microsoft, or Apple account. Once that\u2019s done, you can log in at any time and access the tool directly from your browser, with no installation required.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose a Plan<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"922\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan.webp\" alt=\"chatgpt plan\" class=\"wp-image-14318\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan.webp 1920w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan-300x144.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan-1024x492.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan-768x369.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-plan-1536x738.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>By default, you\u2019ll get free access to GPT-3.5, which is powerful enough for most everyday tasks. However, if you want access to the latest and fastest model (GPT-4o), vision capabilities (analyzing images), file uploads, and a better overall experience, consider subscribing to ChatGPT Plus for $20\/ month.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Explore the Interface<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Once inside, you\u2019ll see a simple chat box at the bottom of the screen. That\u2019s where all the magic happens. You can type your questions, commands, or prompts there. On the left sidebar, you\u2019ll find your chat history, access to tools like voice, image input, file uploads, and a button to customize your settings.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Start Prompting<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"922\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting.webp\" alt=\"start prompting on chatgpt\" class=\"wp-image-14321\" style=\"width:944px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting.webp 1920w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting-300x144.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting-1024x492.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting-768x369.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/chatgpt-start-prompting-1536x738.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You don\u2019t need to use special syntax or coding. Just type what you want, like \u201cWrite a blog outline for social media marketing\u201d or \u201cExplain quantum physics like I\u2019m five\u201d, and hit enter. ChatGPT will respond instantly, generating detailed, human-like replies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mobile &amp; App Access<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Prefer working on the go? ChatGPT offers mobile apps for iOS and Android, featuring many of the same capabilities as the desktop version, including voice chat, camera input, and live video analysis (on GPT-4). Simply download the app, log in, and you\u2019re ready to go.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking to brainstorm, write, research, or just explore ideas, getting started with ChatGPT is as easy as sending a text message, yet far more powerful.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\